WEBVTT

00:00:06.023 --> 00:00:07.232
[sniffs]

00:00:07.274 --> 00:00:08.233
[groans]

00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:11.069
Smell is disgusting...

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:12.029
ly good.

00:00:12.070 --> 00:00:13.656
This is all so great.

00:00:13.698 --> 00:00:15.407
Love it here.

00:00:21.706 --> 00:00:23.081
[hissing]

00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.208
[gasps]

00:00:24.249 --> 00:00:25.835
-What's... -The..

00:00:25.877 --> 00:00:28.086
-Pass... -Word?

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:29.254
Password?

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:30.673
Look! Look at me!

00:00:30.715 --> 00:00:32.257
I am your leader.

00:00:32.299 --> 00:00:35.135
The leader does not recite the password!

00:00:35.177 --> 00:00:37.471
the password, idiots. The leader makes up

00:00:37.513 --> 00:00:39.473
a new password right now. Everybody, I'm making up

00:00:39.515 --> 00:00:41.225
The new password is,

00:00:41.266 --> 00:00:43.936
"Don't ask the leader for the password"!

00:00:46.146 --> 00:00:48.106
Follow me.

00:00:54.989 --> 00:00:57.742
Welcome to the underbelly, brothers.

00:00:57.783 --> 00:01:00.244
Home of the Flushed Pets!

00:01:00.285 --> 00:01:03.080
[cackles]

00:01:06.625 --> 00:01:08.878
[snarling]

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:20.431
[growling]

00:01:22.808 --> 00:01:24.685
Brothers and sisters!

00:01:24.727 --> 00:01:27.187
I've returned from the surface As you see,

00:01:27.229 --> 00:01:29.147
with two new recruits.

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:31.943
These guys are owner killers!

00:01:31.984 --> 00:01:33.527
[cheering] Hey! Hey!

00:01:33.569 --> 00:01:36.113
Settle down!

00:01:36.154 --> 00:01:38.950
Guys, I want you to tell them how you did it.

00:01:38.991 --> 00:01:40.158
Tell them the whole story Go ahead.

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:41.869
about how you took out your owner.

00:01:41.911 --> 00:01:43.037
Don't leave out nothing.

00:01:43.079 --> 00:01:44.705
We love gory detail here.

00:01:44.747 --> 00:01:46.164
-Ah, yeah! -Tell us!

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:47.750
-So tell them, Max. -Right.

00:01:47.792 --> 00:01:50.002
Okay, so I was like... N... Okay.

00:01:50.044 --> 00:01:51.629
-Well, we were like... -Take that!

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:53.255
-Stupid owner. -Yeah!

00:01:53.297 --> 00:01:56.133
So that's-that's who you're dealing with.

00:01:57.426 --> 00:01:59.470
Yeah, that story bored me to death.

00:01:59.511 --> 00:02:00.512
Boring!

00:02:00.554 --> 00:02:02.180
[booing] Give us detail!

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.724
Okay. Max?

00:02:03.766 --> 00:02:06.393
so there's this... Okay, well, uh,

00:02:06.435 --> 00:02:08.020
there's this thing in the kitchen...

00:02:08.062 --> 00:02:09.772
-It's, like, flat. -Yeah. Table!

00:02:09.814 --> 00:02:11.273
-And then round on the... -Toaster!

00:02:11.315 --> 00:02:12.691
just the end of it.

00:02:12.733 --> 00:02:13.776
A spoon?

00:02:13.818 --> 00:02:15.193
-Yes, a spoon! -Exactly.

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.071
You can't hurt someone with a spoon.

00:02:17.113 --> 00:02:19.197
You scoop with a spoon.

00:02:19.239 --> 00:02:20.282
How many people want to know

00:02:20.324 --> 00:02:21.408
how to kill somebody with a spoon?

00:02:21.450 --> 00:02:23.327
[excited murmuring] I do!  Oh, yeah!

00:02:23.368 --> 00:02:26.705
we-we used the spoon, Uh, okay. Uh, well,

00:02:26.747 --> 00:02:28.582
the machine on the counter... hit a button on this,

00:02:28.624 --> 00:02:30.668
Right, right, right, and it's got those... those blades.

00:02:30.709 --> 00:02:33.004
the, uh, it's got blades!  -The, uh, you know, -Oh!

00:02:33.045 --> 00:02:34.338
Was it a blender?

00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:35.631
Whoo!

00:02:35.673 --> 00:02:37.215
You blended somebody?!

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:39.217
the blender, guys. He talking about

00:02:39.259 --> 00:02:41.303
Oh, please tell me it was a blender!

00:02:41.345 --> 00:02:43.221
Hey, buddy, I don't ask what it's called,

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:44.222
we just kill with it.

00:02:44.264 --> 00:02:46.183
-But it was a blender. -Whoo!

00:02:46.224 --> 00:02:47.392
Do y'all hear this?

00:02:47.434 --> 00:02:49.227
You know who was like this?

00:02:49.269 --> 00:02:50.270
Ricky!

00:02:50.312 --> 00:02:52.230
[taps plays faintly] Rest in peace!

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:54.900
Ricky was the only soldier I had

00:02:54.942 --> 00:02:57.611
to kill humans on sight. that was ready

00:02:57.653 --> 00:02:59.613
Everybody else need a pep talk.

00:02:59.655 --> 00:03:01.239
Not these two brothers.

00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:04.118
[cheering] What's going on?

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.872
See, all of us have suffered at the hands of man.

00:03:07.913 --> 00:03:09.331
I mean, take me for instance.

00:03:09.373 --> 00:03:12.168
I was a magician's rabbit for kids' parties.

00:03:12.209 --> 00:03:15.253
But then bunny tricks went out of style.

00:03:15.295 --> 00:03:17.131
So what did my owner do? My owner went

00:03:17.173 --> 00:03:20.051
and left magic behind and made me disappear.

00:03:20.092 --> 00:03:22.302
From his life! [booing]

00:03:22.344 --> 00:03:23.137
Uh-huh.

00:03:23.179 --> 00:03:25.181
I lived in a tattoo parlor.

00:03:25.222 --> 00:03:27.683
used to practice on me. The trainees

00:03:27.725 --> 00:03:30.519
Until they ran out of space!

00:03:30.561 --> 00:03:32.396
humans say they love us. SNOWBALL: I mean, yes,

00:03:32.437 --> 00:03:36.108
and throw us out like garbage. But then they turn around

00:03:36.150 --> 00:03:38.069
Ain't that right, Sea Monkeys?

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:40.278
we don't look like the ad! Hey, it's not our fault

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.530
Yeah!

00:03:41.572 --> 00:03:45.201
All right, you guys are joining the brotherhood.

00:03:45.242 --> 00:03:47.203
-It's initiation time! -Oh, yeah!

00:03:47.244 --> 00:03:49.038
-I'm sorry, what time? -What?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.415
Summon the viper!

00:03:51.456 --> 00:03:53.667
[stomping in unison]

00:03:53.709 --> 00:03:56.212
Uh, is this viper poisonous?

00:03:56.253 --> 00:03:59.256
I'm very allergic to poison! Because I should warn you,

00:04:06.471 --> 00:04:08.348
[grunts]

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:11.185
All right, show her!

00:04:12.352 --> 00:04:14.271
[retching]

00:04:16.607 --> 00:04:18.316
[gasps] Max's collar!

00:04:18.358 --> 00:04:19.401
Where is he?

00:04:19.443 --> 00:04:21.486
Wh-What happened to him?

00:04:21.528 --> 00:04:22.780
I ain't saying nothing.

00:04:22.821 --> 00:04:24.156
[gasps]

00:04:24.198 --> 00:04:26.117
You're gonna tell us where Max is,

00:04:26.158 --> 00:04:28.326
and you're gonna tell us now.

00:04:28.368 --> 00:04:29.661
[chuckles]

00:04:29.703 --> 00:04:31.329
Is this supposed to scare me?

00:04:31.371 --> 00:04:32.330
I'm a cat.

00:04:32.372 --> 00:04:33.457
I land on my feet.

00:04:33.498 --> 00:04:35.251
Does it always happen? 'Cause your head

00:04:35.292 --> 00:04:37.211
it's taken a lot of landings. looks like

00:04:37.253 --> 00:04:38.503
Do you want me to cut ya?

00:04:38.545 --> 00:04:40.256
'Cause I'll cut ya this way and that.

00:04:40.297 --> 00:04:42.340
You'll look like a waffle. [gasps]

00:04:42.382 --> 00:04:43.550
Okay.

00:04:43.592 --> 00:04:46.262
He's too stupid to talk and too ugly to eat.

00:04:46.303 --> 00:04:47.345
[yells]

00:04:47.387 --> 00:04:49.347
-I'm done playing nice! -I...

00:04:49.389 --> 00:04:51.642
Where is Max?!

00:04:51.683 --> 00:04:53.144
Wha...? [stammers, grunts]

00:04:53.185 --> 00:04:54.352
-Wha...? [grunts] -Tell me!

00:04:54.394 --> 00:04:56.147
I-I can...

00:04:56.188 --> 00:04:57.940
Let me finish... Ow!

00:04:57.982 --> 00:04:59.483
Help me! Ow!

00:04:59.524 --> 00:05:00.734
Don't look at him.

00:05:00.776 --> 00:05:01.819
Look at me.

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:03.361
Nobody can help you!

00:05:03.403 --> 00:05:05.948
Where is Max?!

00:05:05.990 --> 00:05:07.992
He-He's in the sewers! Okay, okay!

00:05:08.033 --> 00:05:09.367
He got taken! Please!

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:12.370
Have mercy, adorable puffy dog.

00:05:12.412 --> 00:05:13.371
[gasps]

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:15.749
Snake bite! Snake bite! [chanting]

00:05:15.791 --> 00:05:17.709
Snake bite! Snake bite!

00:05:17.751 --> 00:05:19.711
Snake bite! Snake bite!

00:05:19.753 --> 00:05:21.880
Snake bite! Snake bite!

00:05:21.922 --> 00:05:24.091
Snake bite! Snake bite!

00:05:24.133 --> 00:05:25.383
[sniffing]

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:27.136
[echoing hiss]

00:05:27.178 --> 00:05:28.386
[both gasp]

00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:30.014
As proof of your allegiance,

00:05:30.055 --> 00:05:31.765
you will now receive the bite

00:05:31.807 --> 00:05:34.977
of a one-fanged, half-blind viper

00:05:35.019 --> 00:05:40.232
of anti-human rage! fueled by a diet

00:05:41.984 --> 00:05:44.320
[hissing]

